
@startuml
title Projectory - AI Portfolio Analysis & Career Guidance
autonumber

actor Student
participant "React Frontend" as React
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
database "PostgreSQL / Supabase" as DB
participant "AI / LLM Service" as AI

== Request Career Analysis ==

Student -> React: Open AI Career Guidance page
React --> Student: Display career guidance interface

Student -> React: Click Analyze My Portfolio
React -> API: Request portfolio analysis

API -> API: Verify student authorization
API -> DB: Retrieve student's portfolio data

DB --> API: Education, skills, experience,\nprojects, career interests

API -> API: Prepare portfolio information
API -> AI: Submit relevant portfolio data

alt AI service fails
    AI --> API: Error or unavailable
    API --> React: Analysis failed
    React --> Student: Display error message

else Analysis successful
    AI --> API: Return analysis and recommendations

    note right of API
      Results may include:
      - Portfolio summary (R10)
      - Career paths (R11)
      - Strengths (R12)
      - Areas for improvement (R13)
      - Suggested next steps (R13)
    end note

    API --> React: Return career guidance results
    React --> Student: Display personalized guidance
end

== Refresh Career Analysis ==

opt Student requests updated analysis
    Student -> React: Click Refresh Analysis
    React -> API: Request new analysis
    API -> DB: Retrieve latest saved portfolio
    DB --> API: Updated portfolio information
    API -> AI: Analyze updated portfolio

    alt Refresh fails
        AI --> API: Error
        API --> React: Refresh failed
        React --> Student: Display error message
    else Refresh succeeds
        AI --> API: Updated career guidance
        API --> React: Return updated results
        React --> Student: Display refreshed guidance
    end
end

@enduml
